    "sentence_translations": [
      "(3) So Cool",
      "",
      "Old Guan heard Little Dong say he “wanted to talk” and heard him say he was “often alone”. She also was “often alone”.",
      "",
      "Old Guan thought about it and said, “Okay. What do you want to talk about?”",
      "",
      "Little Dong was very happy and asked, “What is your name?”",
      "",
      "Old Guan said, “My name is Old Guan.”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said. “Hello! Old Guan. You ask me, what is my name?”",
      "",
      "Old Guan asked, “What is your name?”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “My name is Little Dong. ‘Xiao’ [little] in ‘daxiao’ [size] and ‘dong’ [east] in ‘dongxi’ [things], Little Dong!”",
      "",
      "Old Guan said, “Okay.”",
      "",
      "Little Dong asked, “Old Guan, Old Guan, how old are you?”",
      "",
      "Old Guan said, “64 years old.”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said. “64 years old! That’s so cool!",
      "Do you know how old I am? I am 8 years old! I think that I am a big kid now.”",
      "",
      "Old Guan thought that this kid had a lot to say.",
      "She didn’t know what to say. She wanted to say goodbye to him. It was now 8:10 pm. She wanted to go to sleep."
    ]
  }
